**Final instruction to the game developer:**

Build AFTERMATH: THE LAST SURVIVORS as a complete, immersive, realistic 3D open-world zombie survival game. Prioritize working gameplay systems, realistic environmental interaction, meaningful progression, detailed character histories, intelligent zombie AI, persistent cloud saving, and a large variety of equipment and resources.

Do not substitute static images for actual 3D gameplay. Do not use placeholder buttons for essential mechanics. Do not claim a feature is implemented unless it has been tested and works.

Develop the game using modular systems so new characters, zombies, weapons, locations, missions, and survival features can be added without rewriting the entire project.

